WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:04.504
&gt;&gt;&gt; THIS IS A FASCINATING PIECE
OF REPORTING THAT WE'RE GOING TO

00:00:04.504 --> 00:00:07.540
TALKBOUT NOW.
WE'RE GOING TO START WITH THIS

00:00:07.540 --> 00:00:13.179
PHOTO FROM SEPTEMBER 9, 1957
SHOWING DALLAS COWBOYS OWNER

00:00:13.179 --> 00:00:17.550
JERRY JONES AMID A CROWD OF
WHITE STUDENTS TRYING TO KEEP

00:00:17.550 --> 00:00:22.555
BLACK STUDENTS FROM INTEGRATING
AT A ARKANSAS HIGH SCHOOL.

00:00:22.555 --> 00:00:25.959
REPORT THAT JONES WHO WAS 14 AT
THE TIME COULD BE SEEN STANDING

00:00:25.959 --> 00:00:31.664
A FEW YARDS FROM WHERE THE SIX
BLACK STUDENTS WERE JOSTLED AND

00:00:31.664 --> 00:00:37.403
REPELLED WITH RACIAL SLURS BY
RING LEADERS OF THE MOB.

00:00:37.403 --> 00:00:44.878
SO WITH US SALLY JENKINS, WHO
BROKE THIS STORY WITH HER

00:00:44.878 --> 00:00:51.317
CO-AUTHOR DAVID MORAN NIS.
WE'RE HAPPY YOU COULD JOIN US

00:00:51.317 --> 00:00:54.320
THIS MORNING.
THIS WHOLE THING IS --

00:00:54.320 --> 00:00:58.625
&gt;&gt; IT'S STUNNING.
&gt;&gt; LET'S TALK ABOUT THE PICTURE

00:00:58.625 --> 00:01:03.263
AND SEE HOW HE COULD MOVE
DIVERSITY ALONG WITH COACHING

00:01:03.263 --> 00:01:08.201
AND THE SPORT.
WHAT DID YOU LEARN FROM THIS

00:01:08.201 --> 00:01:10.203
PHOTOGRAPH?
&gt;&gt; WELL, I THINK THE FIRST THING

00:01:10.203 --> 00:01:15.675
YOU LEARN IS JUST HOW WIDESPREAD
THE SEGREGATIONISTS WERE IN

00:01:15.675 --> 00:01:18.011
LITTLE ROCK AND NORTH LITTLE
ROCK.

00:01:18.011 --> 00:01:21.414
JERRY JONES' HIGH SCHOOL WAS
NORTH LITTLE ROCK WHICH WAS

00:01:21.414 --> 00:01:23.983
ACROSS THE ARKANSAS RIVER FROM
CENTRAL HIGH SCHOOL, WHICH WAS

00:01:23.983 --> 00:01:28.688
THE SCHOOL THAT GOT ALL THE
ATTENTION WHEN EISENHOWER SENT

00:01:28.688 --> 00:01:33.593
IN TROOPS TO PROTECT THE LITTLE
ROCK NINE.

00:01:33.593 --> 00:01:38.131
BUT THE AGITATORS WERE ACTIVE ON
BOTH SITES AND THE FACT THAT WE

00:01:38.131 --> 00:01:42.202
KNEW THAT GENERATIONALLY JERRY
JONES HAD TO HAVE EXPERIENCED

00:01:42.202 --> 00:01:48.841
THE EVENTS IN LITTLE ROCK MORE
GENERALLY BUT TO FIND HIM IN THE

00:01:48.841 --> 00:01:50.543
ALP
PHOTOGRAPH AND LEARN THAT HE

00:01:50.543 --> 00:01:53.947
EXPERIENCED ONE OF THOSE
INCIDENTS ON THE STEPS WAS

00:01:53.947 --> 00:01:58.451
PRETTY REVELATORY.
&gt;&gt; LET ME ASK YOU ABOUT THIS

00:01:58.451 --> 00:01:59.986
PICTURE.
HE WAS SAYING I WAS JUST THERE,

00:01:59.986 --> 00:02:04.524
I WASN'T PARTICIPATING, I WAS
THERE TO OBSERVE.

00:02:04.524 --> 00:02:07.694
BUT THE -- WITH THE PHOTOGRAPH
WHICH YOU POINT OUT IN YOUR

00:02:07.694 --> 00:02:11.264
REPORTING IN ORDER TO GET WHERE
HE WAS AT THE TOP OF THE STAIRS

00:02:11.264 --> 00:02:14.434
HE HAD TO GET UP QUICKLY AND
THOSE WERE THE STUDENTS KEEPING

00:02:14.434 --> 00:02:17.103
THE BLACK STUDENTS FROM
ENTERING.

00:02:17.103 --> 00:02:19.138
DOES THIS SAY ANYTHING ABOUT HIS
PARTICIPATION?

00:02:19.138 --> 00:02:24.711
ARE YOU MAKING ANY SORT OF
JUDGMENT ABOUT IT?

00:02:24.711 --> 00:02:33.886
&gt;&gt; WELL, TWO THINGS.
FIRST OF ALL -- SO HE'S ACTUALLY

00:02:33.886 --> 00:02:36.556
YOUNGER THAN THE RING LEADERS
YOU CAN SEE IN THE PHOTOGRAPHS.

00:02:36.556 --> 00:02:39.993
THAT'S ONE THING WE NOTICED.
WE LOOKED AT A SEQUENCE OF

00:02:39.993 --> 00:02:44.030
PHOTOS LEADING UP TO THOSE STEPS
AND THE WHITE TEENAGERS ON THE

00:02:44.030 --> 00:02:47.100
STEPS DID HAVE TO MOVE AROUND
THE BLACK STUDENTS TO GET TO THE

00:02:47.100 --> 00:02:53.706
TOP OF THE STEPS.
NEVERTHELESS, HE IS FURTHER

00:02:53.706 --> 00:02:54.907
BACK, HE IS YOUNGER THAN THE
LEAD PARTICIPANTS.

00:02:54.907 --> 00:02:59.045
SO I THINK THAT YOU SIMPLY HAVE
TO TAKE HIM AT HIS WORD UNLESS

00:02:59.045 --> 00:03:02.381
SOMETHING ELSE APPEARS THAT HE
WAS THERE MORE OUT OF CURIOSITY

00:03:02.381 --> 00:03:07.587
AND FASCINATION AS OPPOSED TO
BEING AT THE EPICENTER OF THE

00:03:07.587 --> 00:03:10.023
ACTIVE EVENTS.
ONE THING HE TOLD US THAT HE DID

00:03:10.023 --> 00:03:13.259
NOT MAKE IT IN THE STORY IS HE
REMEMBERS IT GOT PHYSICAL.

00:03:13.259 --> 00:03:16.829
THE TOUGH GUYS YOU SEE IN THE
CENTER OF THE PHOTOGRAPH END UP

00:03:16.829 --> 00:03:19.799
REALLY PUSHING THE KIDS DOWN OFF
THE STEPS.

00:03:19.799 --> 00:03:22.235
AND, IN FACT, ONE OF THEM IS
ARRESTED.

00:03:22.235 --> 00:03:25.505
&gt;&gt; I HOPE EVERYONE TAKES A
MOMENT TO READ THE REPORTING

00:03:25.505 --> 00:03:27.774
THAT YOU AND DAVID DID AS THEY
WATCH FOOTBALL.

00:03:27.774 --> 00:03:30.643
THE REASON YOU DID THIS IS NOT
JUST ABOUT THAT PHOTO.

00:03:30.643 --> 00:03:33.613
IT'S ABOUT WHAT IT MEANS WITH
HIS POSITION OF POWER IN THE

00:03:33.613 --> 00:03:38.184
LEAGUE NOW AND THE NFL NOW, AND
THE POSITION AND POWER THE

00:03:38.184 --> 00:03:39.752
COWBOYS HAVE.
THIS IS PART OF WHAT "THE

00:03:39.752 --> 00:03:45.258
WASHINGTON POST" IS DOING,
EXAMINING THE NFL'S DECADES LONG

00:03:45.258 --> 00:03:48.795
FAILURE TO PROMOTE BLACK
COACHES, RIGHT?

00:03:48.795 --> 00:03:50.530
&gt;&gt; YES.
&gt;&gt; AND I -- GO AHEAD.

00:03:50.530 --> 00:03:54.901
&gt;&gt; THIS STORY IS PART OF A LONG
SERIES WE'VE BEEN DOING CALLED

00:03:54.901 --> 00:03:58.271
BLACKOUT, WHICH IS EXAMINING THE
ISSUES IN THE LEAGUE ABOUT THE

00:03:58.271 --> 00:04:02.208
FACT THAT ALMOST 70% OF THE
WORKFORCE IS BLACK AND YET THERE

00:04:02.208 --> 00:04:05.812
ARE ONLY THREE HEAD COACHES.
ONE OF THE THINGS OUR DATA HAS

00:04:05.812 --> 00:04:11.818
FOUND IS THAT MID LEVEL -- BLACK
COACHES WHO DO MANAGE TO GET

00:04:11.818 --> 00:04:16.188
HEAD COACHING JOBS WAITED AN
AVERAGE OF NINE YEARS LONGER IN

00:04:16.188 --> 00:04:20.193
MID LEVEL ASSISTANCE COACHING
PARTS THAN THEIR WHITE COUNTER

00:04:20.193 --> 00:04:23.596
PARTS SO THERE'S STRIKING
INEQUITIES WITHIN THE LEAGUE AS

00:04:23.596 --> 00:04:26.966
THE LEAGUE ADMITS.
JERRY JONES WAS THE ONLY OWNER

00:04:26.966 --> 00:04:30.169
TO TALK TO US IN THIS SERIES IN
ANY WAY.

00:04:30.169 --> 00:04:33.339
WE GIVE HIM CREDIT FOR SITTING
DOWN AND HAVING THIS DIFFICULT

00:04:33.339 --> 00:04:35.942
CONVERSATION.
&gt;&gt; I'M GLAD YOU BRING IT UP.

00:04:35.942 --> 00:04:38.844
THEY ALL SHOULD HAVE TALKED TO
YOU BY THE WAY.

00:04:38.844 --> 00:04:44.417
ONE OF THE WELL KNOWN RETIRED
SPORTS CASTERS IN DALLAS, DALE

00:04:44.417 --> 00:04:48.921
HANSON, SAID WHAT FRUSTRATES ME
MOST IS THAT JERRY JONES IS IN

00:04:48.921 --> 00:04:55.995
SUCH A POSITION THAT IF HE TAKES
A STRONG CHANCE HE COULD BE THE

00:04:55.995 --> 00:04:59.932
CHANGE IN THE LEAGUE.
AND IT SEEMS THAT JERRY JONES

00:04:59.932 --> 00:05:01.634
AGREES.
&gt;&gt; HE DID AGREE.

00:05:01.634 --> 00:05:04.370
THAT WAS ONE OF THE MORE
INTERESTING THINGS IN OUR

00:05:04.370 --> 00:05:07.306
CONVERSATION WITH HIM WHICH
LASTED WELL OVER TWO AND A HALF

00:05:07.306 --> 00:05:09.409
HOURS P.
HE SAID, I UNDERSTAND THAT, I

00:05:09.409 --> 00:05:12.478
AGREE WITH THAT.
WE DISCUSSED WHY HE HADN'T BEEN

00:05:12.478 --> 00:05:14.981
AT THE FOREFRONT OF THIS ISSUE
UNTIL NOW.

00:05:14.981 --> 00:05:18.451
AND THE SHORT ANSWER TO THAT IS
THAT HE'S BEEN MORE CONCERNED

00:05:18.451 --> 00:05:23.923
WITH TRYING TO WIN, YOU KNOW,
SUPER BOWLS AND APPOINTING MEN

00:05:23.923 --> 00:05:33.132
WHO WERE OLD FRIENDS OF HIS OR
WHO HE KNEW TO THE JOB.

00:05:33.132 --> 00:05:37.503
HIS SECOND HEAD COACH WAS BARRY
SWITZER, A GUY HE WENT WAY BACK

00:05:37.503 --> 00:05:40.806
TO ARKANSAS WITH.
SO HE'S FORTHRIGHT IN TRYING TO

00:05:40.806 --> 00:05:44.677
ADDRESS THESE TOUGH QUESTIONS.
IT DOESN'T MEAN YOU'LL ALWAYS BE

00:05:44.677 --> 00:05:48.181
SATISFIED BY HIS ANSWERS.
BUT HE WAS ONE OF THE ONLY

00:05:48.181 --> 00:05:51.617
OWNERS -- THE ONLY OWNER TO SIT
DOWN AND TALK TO US TO THIS

00:05:51.617 --> 00:05:54.687
EXTENT ABOUT IT.
&gt;&gt; YOU HAVE TO GIVE HIM CREDIT.

00:05:54.687 --> 00:05:58.057
BUT THERE ARE FAILURES, THERE
ARE FAILURES IN THE NFL AS THIS

00:05:58.057 --> 00:06:00.793
IS POINTING OUT.
AS YOU HAVE BEEN REPORTING THIS,

00:06:00.793 --> 00:06:03.463
SALLY, IT'S GREAT, EVERYONE
SHOULD READ THIS.

00:06:03.463 --> 00:06:06.833
IT'S FASCINATING.
SO WHAT'S THE SOLUTION HERE?

00:06:06.833 --> 00:06:10.670
WHAT DO YOU THINK SHOULD BE
DONE?

00:06:10.670 --> 00:06:16.442
&gt;&gt; WELL, I THINK ONE SOLUTION IS
THE NFL HAS LAUNCHED AN

00:06:16.442 --> 00:06:19.145
INAUGURAL ACCELERATOR PROGRAM.
IT'S NOT A SOLUTION.

00:06:19.145 --> 00:06:22.815
IT'S A TOOL.
IT'S A MECHANISM TO TRY TO HELP

00:06:22.815 --> 00:06:26.285
OWNERS GET TO KNOW OWNERS MORE
PERSONALLY.

00:06:26.285 --> 00:06:29.689
A LOT OF TIMES WHAT THEY LACK
ARE THE CLOSE PERSONAL

00:06:29.689 --> 00:06:32.825
RELATIONSHIPS.
THAT'S ONE THING WE'VE HEARD.

00:06:32.825 --> 00:06:35.995
OWNERS DON'T SPEND MUCH TIME
WITH THEM.

00:06:35.995 --> 00:06:38.598
YOU KNOW, OWNERS TALK TO LOTS OF
HEAD COACHES.

00:06:38.598 --> 00:06:42.902
THEY TALK TO VERY FEW ASSISTANT
COACHES.

00:06:42.902 --> 00:06:46.906
IF YOU'RE AN OWNER OF THE GIANTS
OR THE COWBOYS YOU'RE NOT

00:06:46.906 --> 00:06:50.409
SPENDING A GREAT DEAL OF TIME
TALKING TO YOUR RUNNING BACKS

00:06:50.409 --> 00:06:52.945
COACH.
SO THIS ACCELERATOR PROGRAM IS

00:06:52.945 --> 00:06:55.515
ONE IDEA TO TRY TO GET THE
RELATIONSHIPS MOVING ALONG.

00:06:55.515 --> 00:06:59.452
WE'LL SEE IF IT WORKS.
QUITE FRANKLY, A MUCH BETTER

00:06:59.452 --> 00:07:05.858
IDEA IS FOR A TEAM LIKE THE
DALLAS COWBOYS, A MAKER OF

00:07:05.858 --> 00:07:10.930
MANORS, TO HIRE A BLACK HEAD
COACH, HAVE A WINNING RECORD AND

00:07:10.930 --> 00:07:20.306
WIN A SUPER BOWL WITH ONE.
WHEN TONY DUNGY WAS HIRED AND

00:07:20.306 --> 00:07:25.745
WON A SUPER BOWL WITH THE COLTS,
IT LOOKED LIKE IT WAS GOING TO

00:07:25.745 --> 00:07:29.582
TRIGGER MOVING FORWARD.
&gt;&gt; SALLY JENKINS JOINS US.

00:07:29.582 --> 00:07:34.887
AND DAVID MORANIS IS THE
CO-WRITER JT JERRY JONES HELPED

00:07:34.887 --> 00:07:38.090
TRANSFORM THE NFL EXCEPT WEN
WHEN IT COMES TO RACE.

00:07:38.090 --> 00:07:40.826
IT'S A FASCINATING READ.
I THINK EVERYONE SHOULD CHECK IT

00:07:40.826 --> 00:07:42.995
OUT.
THANK YOU, HAPPY THANKSGIVING TO

